{"mode": "live", "backend": "cli", "model": "sonnet", "seconds": 48.1, "shop": "小滿便當（模擬店家）", "steps": [{"i": 1, "thought": "先看資料夾裡有哪些檔案，才能知道有哪些對帳單與老闆備註。", "tool": "list_files", "args": {}, "result": {"files": ["A_ads.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_orders.csv", "B_ads.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_orders.csv", "contract.json", "menu_costs.csv", "owner_note.txt", "platform_menu.csv", "pos_direct.csv", "promos.csv"]}, "t": 3.0}, {"i": 2, "thought": "先讀老闆備註和各對帳單的表頭，了解欄位與限制。", "tool": "read_file", "args": {"names": ["owner_note.txt", "A_orders.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_ads.csv", "B_orders.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_ads.csv"], "max_lines": 4}, "result": {"owner_note.txt": {"total_lines": 4, "head": ["老闆備註：", "1. 排骨便當是我們的招牌，不能下架，要漲的話最多漲 10 元。", "2. 平台 A 的「滿 199 折 40（店家全額負擔）」（活動代碼 A-PROMO1）是跟業務簽好的，這個月還不能退。", "3. 其他品項可以調，但單一品項不要一次漲超過兩成，客人會嚇到。"]}, "A_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 1116, "head": ["訂單編號,訂單日期,商品小計,店家負擔折扣,平台負擔折扣,活動代碼,佣金,佣金營業稅,廣告活動,調整金額,調整說明品項,撥款金額", "A09-00001,2026-10-02,100,0,0,,32,2,,0,,66", "A09-00002,2026-10-15,330,40,0,A-PROMO1,93,5,,0,,192", "A09-00003,2026-10-31,140,0,0,,45,2,,0,,93"]}, "A_items.csv": {"total_lines": 2185, "head": ["訂單編號,品項,數量,單價", "A09-00001,素食便當,1,100", "A09-00002,素食便當,2,100", "A09-00002,滷蛋,2,20"]}, "A_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 63, "head": ["日期,廣告活動,花費", "2026-10-01,A-AD1,178", "2026-10-02,A-AD1,178", "2026-10-03,A-AD1,178"]}, "B_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 970, "head": ["單號,成立時間,餐點金額(含稅),商家補貼優惠,平台補貼優惠,優惠方案,服務費,服務費稅額,推廣來源,客訴扣款,問題餐點,實際入帳", "B09-00917,2026/10/25,110,0,0,,-36,-2,,0,,72", "B09-00918,2026/10/17,150,0,0,,-49,-2,,0,,99", "B09-00919,2026/10/6,250,0,0,,-81,-4,,0,,165"]}, "B_items.csv": {"total_lines": 1836, "head": ["單號,餐點名稱,份數,售價", "B09-00917,排骨便當,1,110", "B09-00918,魚排便當,1,120", "B09-00918,味噌湯,1,30"]}, "B_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 32, "head": ["扣款日,推廣活動,推廣費", "2026/10/1,B-AD1,-66", "2026/10/2,B-AD1,-66", "2026/10/3,B-AD1,-66"]}}, "t": 6.0}, {"i": 3, "thought": "先提交平台 A 的欄位對應。A 的佣金和稅是正數，手算兩筆樣本，撥款金額都對得上，所以先用這組對應讓 ingest 檢查。", "tool": "ingest", "args": {"platform": "A", "mapping": {"orders": {"order_id": "訂單編號", "date": "訂單日期", "subtotal": "商品小計", "merchant_discount": "店家負擔折扣", "platform_discount": "平台負擔折扣", "promo_id": "活動代碼", "commission": "佣金", "commission_tax": "佣金營業稅", "ad_campaign": "廣告活動", "adjustment": "調整金額", "refund_item": "調整說明品項", "payout": "撥款金額"}, "lines": {"order_id": "訂單編號", "item": "品項", "qty": "數量", "unit_price": "單價"}, "ads": {"date": "日期", "campaign": "廣告活動", "spend": "花費"}}}, "result": {"platform": "A", "ok": true, "errors": [], "orders": 1115, "payout_total": 125824, "ad_spend_total": 6039, "payout_match": 1.0, "lines_match": 1.0, "commission_match": 1.0, "effective_rate": 0.32, "contract_rate": 0.32, "unknown_items": []}, "t": 12.0}, {"i": 4, "thought": "平台 A 已通過檢查，接著提交平台 B 的欄位對應。B 的表頭名稱不同，佣金和廣告費是負數，先送出看檢查結果。", "tool": "ingest", "args": {"platform": "B", "mapping": {"orders": {"order_id": "單號", "date": "成立時間", "subtotal": "餐點金額(含稅)", "merchant_discount": "商家補貼優惠", "platform_discount": "平台補貼優惠", "promo_id": "優惠方案", "commission": "服務費", "commission_tax": "服務費稅額", "ad_campaign": "推廣來源", "adjustment": "客訴扣款", "refund_item": "問題餐點", "payout": "實際入帳"}, "lines": {"order_id": "單號", "item": "餐點名稱", "qty": "份數", "unit_price": "售價"}, "ads": {"date": "扣款日", "campaign": "推廣活動", "spend": "推廣費"}}}, "result": {"platform": "B", "ok": true, "errors": [], "orders": 969, "payout_total": 110800, "ad_spend_total": 2064, "payout_match": 1.0, "lines_match": 1.0, "commission_match": 1.0, "effective_rate": 0.3253, "contract_rate": 0.325, "unknown_items": []}, "t": 17.4}, {"i": 5, "thought": "兩個平台對帳單都通過檢查了，接下來把老闆備註的限制轉成結構化限制：排骨便當不能下架且最多漲10元、A-PROMO1不能退、單一品項最多漲兩成。", "tool": "set_constraints", "args": {"protected_items": ["排骨便當"], "max_raise": {"排骨便當": 10}, "max_raise_pct": 0.2, "locked_promos": ["A-PROMO1"]}, "result": {"constraints": {"protected_items": ["排骨便當"], "max_raise": {"排骨便當": 10}, "max_raise_pct": 0.2, "locked_promos": ["A-PROMO1"]}}, "t": 21.1}, {"i": 6, "thought": "限制已設定好，接下來用 analyze 取得每個品項、活動、廣告、退款的實拿數字，找出有問題的地方。", "tool": "analyze", "args": {}, "result": {"totals": {"sales": 399020, "payout": 236624, "commission": 130196, "merchant_discount": 28725, "refunds": 3475, "ad_spend": 8103, "var_cost": 202803, "actual_contribution": 25718, "contribution_now": 25267, "contribution_next": 20210, "rate_change_impact": -5057, "direct_contribution": 227711, "direct_sales": 412540, "orders": 2084, "by_platform_next": {"A": 13516, "B": 14797}, "aov": {"A": 186, "B": 198}}, "problem_items": [{"platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 110.0, "dine": 110.0, "qty": 402, "sales": 44220, "unit_now": -2.9, "unit_next": -5.8, "month_next": -4289, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 100.0, "dine": 100.0, "qty": 175, "sales": 17500, "unit_now": -0.3, "unit_next": -2.9, "month_next": -1398, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 110.0, "dine": 110.0, "qty": 317, "sales": 34870, "unit_now": -3.3, "unit_next": -3.3, "month_next": -1381, "status": "loss"}], "ok_item_count": 21, "top_revenue_items": [{"platform": "A", "item": "雞腿便當", "sales": 46760, "unit_next": 22.5, "status": "ok"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "sales": 44220, "unit_next": -5.8, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "魚排便當", "sales": 38400, "unit_next": 12.0, "status": "ok"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "sales": 34870, "unit_next": -3.3, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "雞腿便當", "sales": 33150, "unit_next": 32.0, "status": "ok"}], "promos": [{"key": "A-PROMO1", "platform": "A", "name": "滿 199 折 40（店家全額負擔）", "orders": 373, "merchant_discount": 14920, "contribution": 2936, "per_order": 7.9, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "B-PROMO1", "platform": "B", "name": "魚排便當 買一送一", "orders": 111, "merchant_discount": 13320, "contribution": -9640, "per_order": -86.8, "status": "loss"}, {"key": "B-PROMO2", "platform": "B", "name": "古早味紅茶 8 折", "orders": 84, "merchant_discount": 485, "contribution": 2609, "per_order": 31.1, "status": "ok"}], "ads": [{"key": "A-AD1", "platform": "A", "spend": 5526, "orders": 232, "sales": 42095, "contribution": 3191, "net_if_all_incremental": -2335, "status": "loss"}, {"key": "A-AD2", "platform": "A", "spend": 513, "orders": 169, "sales": 30450, "contribution": 2309, "net_if_all_incremental": 1796, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "B-AD1", "platform": "B", "spend": 2064, "orders": 239, "sales": 46110, "contribution": 5886, "net_if_all_incremental": 3822, "status": "ok"}], "refunds": [{"key": "貢丸湯", "item": "貢丸湯", "refund_orders": 45, "orders_with_item": 389, "rate": 0.1157, "amount": 1880, "status": "hot"}, {"key": "控肉便當", "item": "控肉便當", "refund_orders": 2, "orders_with_item": 155, "rate": 0.0129, "amount": 240, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "魚排便當", "item": "魚排便當", "refund_orders": 3, "orders_with_item": 343, "rate": 0.0087, "amount": 320, "status": "ok"}], "legend": "unit_next＝新費率下每賣一份實拿幾元；status: loss＝賠錢, thin＝幾乎沒賺；ads 的 loss＝就算帶來的單全算廣告功勞也不划算, doubt＝若一半的單本來就會來則不划算"}, "t": 24.9}, {"i": 7, "thought": "有問題的品項是 A 排骨便當、A 魚排便當、B 排骨便當，先用 price_options 看各種售價的試算，再決定調價。", "tool": "price_options", "args": {"targets": [["A", "排骨便當"], ["A", "魚排便當"], ["B", "排骨便當"]]}, "result": {"options": [{"platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "current_price": 110.0, "max_allowed_price": 120, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 115.0, "unit_after": -2.7, "est_month_delta": 1390}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 0.3, "est_month_delta": 2616}], "delist_est_month_delta": 6128}, {"platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "current_price": 100.0, "max_allowed_price": 120, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 105.0, "unit_after": 0.1, "est_month_delta": 576}, {"price": 110.0, "unit_after": 3.2, "est_month_delta": 1074}, {"price": 115.0, "unit_after": 6.3, "est_month_delta": 1494}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 9.3, "est_month_delta": 1837}], "delist_est_month_delta": 775}, {"platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "current_price": 110.0, "max_allowed_price": 120, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 115.0, "unit_after": -0.2, "est_month_delta": 1049}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 3.0, "est_month_delta": 1956}], "delist_est_month_delta": 2210}], "note": "est_month_delta＝預估每月多留下幾元（假設售價每漲 1% 銷量掉 1.5%）"}, "t": 28.1}, {"i": 8, "thought": "排骨便當兩個平台各漲到上限 120 元，A 平台魚排便當調到 115 元。再結束賠錢的 B-PROMO1、停掉 A-AD1 廣告、替貢丸湯換防漏包材，然後用 simulate 檢查有沒有違反老闆的限制。", "tool": "simulate", "args": {"actions": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 115}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "B", "promo_id": "B-PROMO1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1"}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "貢丸湯"}]}, "result": {"base_next_month": 20210, "est_total_delta": 20416, "per_action": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120, "est_delta": 2616}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120, "est_delta": 1956}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 115, "est_delta": 1494}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "B", "promo_id": "B-PROMO1", "est_delta": 10805}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1", "est_delta": 3931}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "貢丸湯", "est_delta": 45}], "violations": []}, "t": 34.3}, {"i": 9, "thought": "模擬沒有違反限制，整組動作可以交出，現在寫給老闆看的說明。", "tool": "finish", "args": {"actions": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 115}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "B", "promo_id": "B-PROMO1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1"}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "貢丸湯"}], "report": "# 老闆，這個月外送帳這樣調\n\n我只動有問題的地方，其他都沒碰。排骨便當沒下架，漲價也沒超過你說的 10 元。\n\n## 1. 排骨便當：兩個平台各漲到 120 元\n- 平台 A：現在每賣一份實拿 -2.9 元。新費率下會變 -5.8 元。\n- 平台 B：現在每賣一份實拿 -3.3 元。\n- 漲到 120 元後，A 每份實拿 0.3 元，B 每份實拿 3.0 元。\n- 預估每月多留下：A 是 2616 元，B 是 1956 元。\n- A 還是只有 0.3 元，幾乎沒賺。你規定最多漲 10 元，所以只能到這。它是招牌，我們先撐著。\n\n## 2. 平台 A 魚排便當：從 100 元漲到 115 元\n- 現在每賣一份實拿 -0.3 元，新費率下會變 -2.9 元。\n- 漲到 115 元後，每份實拿 6.3 元。\n- 預估每月多留下 1494 元。\n\n## 3. 平台 B「魚排便當 買一送一」：退出\n- 這個活動用掉 111 單，店家出了 13320 元折扣。\n- 平均每一單實拿 -86.8 元，整個活動共賠 9640 元。\n- 退出後，預估每月多留下 10805 元。這是最大的一筆。\n\n## 4. 平台 A 廣告 A-AD1：停掉\n- 花了 5526 元，帶來 232 單。\n- 就算這些單全算廣告的功勞，扣掉廣告費還是賠 2335 元。\n- 停掉後，預估每月多留下 3931 元。\n- 平台 A 的 A-AD2 和平台 B 的 B-AD1 都有賺，繼續留著。\n\n## 5. 貢丸湯：換防漏包材\n- 有貢丸湯的 389 單裡，45 單被退款，退款金額共 1880 元。\n- 換防漏包材後，預估每月多留下 45 元。\n\n## 提醒：A-PROMO1 不能退\n- 「滿 199 折 40」是你簽好的，這個月我沒動它。\n- 好消息是它目前還有賺：373 單，平均每單實拿 7.9 元。\n\n## 合計\n- 照現在的做法，下個月預估留下 20210 元。\n- 這組動作做完，預估一共多留下 20416 元。\n- 試算過了，沒有違反你的任何限制。"}, "result": {"ok": true, "violations": [], "est_total_delta": 20416}, "t": 48.1}], "final": {"actions": [{"type": "end_promo", "platform": "B", "promo_id": "B-PROMO1", "est_delta": 10805, "reason": "「魚排便當 買一送一」上個月 111 單，扣掉折扣後每單平均實拿 -86.8 元。"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1", "est_delta": 3931, "reason": "廣告 A-AD1 花了 5,526 元，帶來的 232 單總共實拿 3,191 元。"}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120, "est_delta": 2616, "old_price": 110.0, "reason": "平台 A 的排骨便當：售價 110 元，新費率下每賣一份實拿 -5.8 元，上個月賣了 402 份。調到 120 元後每份實拿 0.3 元。"}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 120, "est_delta": 1956, "old_price": 110.0, "reason": "平台 B 的排骨便當：售價 110 元，新費率下每賣一份實拿 -3.3 元，上個月賣了 317 份。調到 120 元後每份實拿 3.0 元。"}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 115, "est_delta": 1494, "old_price": 100.0, "reason": "平台 A 的魚排便當：售價 100 元，新費率下每賣一份實拿 -2.9 元，上個月賣了 175 份。調到 115 元後每份實拿 6.3 元。"}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "貢丸湯", "est_delta": 45, "reason": "貢丸湯有 11.6% 的訂單被退款（45/389），上個月被扣 1,880 元。換防漏包材每份多約 3 元。"}], "report": "# 老闆，這個月外送帳這樣調\n\n我只動有問題的地方，其他都沒碰。排骨便當沒下架，漲價也沒超過你說的 10 元。\n\n## 1. 排骨便當：兩個平台各漲到 120 元\n- 平台 A：現在每賣一份實拿 -2.9 元。新費率下會變 -5.8 元。\n- 平台 B：現在每賣一份實拿 -3.3 元。\n- 漲到 120 元後，A 每份實拿 0.3 元，B 每份實拿 3.0 元。\n- 預估每月多留下：